WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.375
All living things are made of cells: one, or many.

2
00:00:04.151 --> 00:00:08.251
A bacterium and a yeast cell: each one is a whole living thing.

3
00:00:11.335 --> 00:00:15.685
Yeast has a nucleus; a bacterium has none, but both are cells.

4
00:00:16.465 --> 00:00:20.540
Your body is trillions of cells; a bacterium is just one.
